/* The input language reserves br for nondeterministic choice, which every
   state reads into itself on both children.  An automaton that gives br a
   transition of its own would give it a second meaning and make the output
   automaton nondeterministic, so the input is refused with an error naming
   the reason. */
%BEGING
Main -> br a a.
%ENDG
%BEGINA
q0 br -> qbad qbad.
q0 a -> .
qbad b -> .
%ENDA
%BEGINT
Main : q0.
%ENDT
